    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/17f362045e6a1c8e20b00f1d76cc3e82.poster.avif?t=1754426539\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/17f362045e6a1c8e20b00f1d76cc3e82.webm?t=1754426539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/17f362045e6a1c8e20b00f1d76cc3e82.mp4?t=1754426539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Survive the Desert. Conquer the Dunes. Dominate the War for Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sands show no mercy. The desert is vast, scorching, and full of opportunities for those bold enough to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where fuel, metal, and ammo are more valuable than trust, you must explore the dunes, capture camps, gather resources, and forge your path to dominance. It all starts with a vehicle \u2014 fast, strong, and deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful. Not every encounter ends in peace. Not every trade is what it seems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your own war vehicle with speed, armor, and firepower. It\u2019s your weapon, your shield, and your lifeline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open desert world filled with camps, producer towns, and shifting trade routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for essential resources like fuel, ammo, metal, and water in hostile and highly contested zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with vendors and players in producer towns, exchanging goods for upgrades, repairs, and rare supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a faction and fight to control key production villages that generate valuable resources over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escort your faction\u2019s convoys to the main city or ambush enemy transports and claim their cargo for yourself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive scorching sandstorms and freezing desert nights, adapting your strategy to harsh environments and shifting threats</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game for the Determined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game for those who don\u2019t fear losing everything \u2014 and keep going anyway. For those who know that surviving out here is earned through strategy, courage, and raw strength. Every resource matters. Every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the desert?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your Wishlist and prepare to live on the edge.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/0b5a5b3619a3e6f363580faf54c0ad91.poster.avif?t=1754426539\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/0b5a5b3619a3e6f363580faf54c0ad91.webm?t=1754426539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/0b5a5b3619a3e6f363580faf54c0ad91.mp4?t=1754426539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/17f362045e6a1c8e20b00f1d76cc3e82.poster.avif?t=1754426539\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/17f362045e6a1c8e20b00f1d76cc3e82.webm?t=1754426539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/17f362045e6a1c8e20b00f1d76cc3e82.mp4?t=1754426539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Survive the Desert. Conquer the Dunes. Dominate the War for Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sands show no mercy. The desert is vast, scorching, and full of opportunities for those bold enough to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where fuel, metal, and ammo are more valuable than trust, you must explore the dunes, capture camps, gather resources, and forge your path to dominance. It all starts with a vehicle \u2014 fast, strong, and deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful. Not every encounter ends in peace. Not every trade is what it seems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your own war vehicle with speed, armor, and firepower. It\u2019s your weapon, your shield, and your lifeline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open desert world filled with camps, producer towns, and shifting trade routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for essential resources like fuel, ammo, metal, and water in hostile and highly contested zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with vendors and players in producer towns, exchanging goods for upgrades, repairs, and rare supplies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a faction and fight to control key production villages that generate valuable resources over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escort your faction\u2019s convoys to the main city or ambush enemy transports and claim their cargo for yourself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive scorching sandstorms and freezing desert nights, adapting your strategy to harsh environments and shifting threats</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game for the Determined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game for those who don\u2019t fear losing everything \u2014 and keep going anyway. For those who know that surviving out here is earned through strategy, courage, and raw strength. Every resource matters. Every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the desert?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your Wishlist and prepare to live on the edge.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/0b5a5b3619a3e6f363580faf54c0ad91.poster.avif?t=1754426539\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/0b5a5b3619a3e6f363580faf54c0ad91.webm?t=1754426539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490510/extras/0b5a5b3619a3e6f363580faf54c0ad91.mp4?t=1754426539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
